flowchart TB
    Dev["Developer\n(Maya, on a Tier-1 team)"]
    Meta["Business Metadata\n(risk tier, budget, owner, routability - read only, from the system of record)"]
    Input["Blurb / POC repo / legacy repo\n(whatever she already has)"]
    Extract["Extraction Agent\n(NL parse or static code read, never executes code)"]
    Confirm["Confirm-or-Correct checkpoint\n(what she described + fixed team constraints, conflicts flagged)"]
    Policy["Policy Engine\n(templates scoped by tier, budget, routable regions)"]
    Prov["Provisioning API\n(clusters, namespaces)"]
    Traffic["Traffic Management API\n(LB, DNS, routing)"]
    Sec["Security & Compliance\n(existing IAM/secrets templates - selected, not generated)"]
    Obs["Observability\n(default dashboards/alerts)"]
    PR["Generated Pull Request\n(diff + plain-language rationale)"]
    Reviewer["Senior Engineer\n(Dev, the skeptic)"]
    Prod["Production"]

    Dev -->|"provides"| Input
    Dev -.->|"team identity resolves"| Meta
    Input -->|"parsed by"| Extract
    Meta -->|"fixed constraints feed"| Extract
    Extract -->|"drafts intent record"| Confirm
    Confirm -->|"developer confirms"| Policy
    Confirm -.->|"developer corrects"| Extract
    Policy -->|"selects modules from"| Prov
    Policy --> Traffic
    Policy --> Sec
    Policy --> Obs
    Prov --> PR
    Traffic --> PR
    Sec --> PR
    Obs --> PR
    PR -->|"reviews and approves"| Reviewer
    Reviewer -->|"merge = only path to"| Prod
    Prod -.->|"deploy event feeds metrics"| Input
